{"time": 1755572641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496014793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（唉  那就算了）"}
{"time": 1755572693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614215329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“这一点想来他们也心知肚明。面子上的话，听听也罢。”"}
{"time": 1755572725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989056344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那么下一个问题，你为何不肯现身？”"}
{"time": 1755572810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483244305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“你误会了，我并非不肯现身，而是一直在你身旁”"}
{"time": 1755572895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292527255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“嗯……可能我需要一种比较具体的方式展式给你？”"}
{"time": 1755572955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151731180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“好。看来你并非现世之物。那你以此态，要如何厮杀，又要如何捧起圣杯？”"}
{"time": 1755572965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383165040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#你听着，原本中性的声音逐渐转化为少女的嗓音，在不经意间出现在侧眼的边缘"}
{"time": 1755572989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096485805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“啧啧啧，有意思”"}
{"time": 1755572991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523303113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“毕竟，圣杯也不完全是现实之物啊”"}
