{"time": 1755656424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946142217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "你的从者，和她口中描述的双马尾女人，都在这房间里"}
