{"time": 1755672124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462661752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“唉～小嘴还挺甜的。没关系，我就是逗逗你玩的”"}
{"time": 1755672128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205125266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*比划个鬼脸"}
{"time": 1755672136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800398192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1796715519]（接）"}
{"time": 1755672229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050632864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“不瞒花火大人，我们差点被敌人击败了”*御主"}
{"time": 1755672290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682701748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“不过比起击败敌人，我更想问问这里的灵脉我们能不能借用一下”"}
{"time": 1755672340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691198435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“呀？不是今天早上才开始的嘛，这么早就开始打架了”"}
{"time": 1755672353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122659539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“我还以为你们会先手拉手逛一天街呢”"}
{"time": 1755672382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202469518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“没关系，你们要用多久？”"}
{"time": 1755672403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803560764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“毕竟刚刚被一个很坏的人要走了承诺又敲了一大笔钱，现在我也想给花火大人一场好戏看，这不是苦于…嗯”"}
{"time": 1755672409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302203368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“我这里可保不齐还有别的组也会来哦，其中没准就有你的敌人”"}
{"time": 1755672634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433754024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“可能5个小时左右吧，在这期间我猜花火大人对我的经历会感兴趣”"}
{"time": 1755672650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200530892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1302203368][CQ:at,qq=1985245608] “我当然明白，但是故事听到一半被打断也很苦恼吧”"}
{"time": 1755672670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332040149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（被裹挟了）"}
