{"time": 1755779888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148502874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=727789237]”那万神庙的人怎么办？“"}
