{"time": 1755950422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467056168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“烟雾镜”推开了门，先看了电脑，之后拎起了娃娃。娃娃的眼睛亮了起来“你好呀，小使魔~”"}
{"time": 1755950531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110911583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“外面的从者是你的？”\n“不是啦，我可没有从者~”娃娃摇头晃脑“和你们都不一样~”"}
{"time": 1755950575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593599370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（是那种娃娃流水本体也会同步感官的娃娃吗）"}
{"time": 1755950588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128390571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（？）"}
